### Connection Flow
```
FrontDesk Chatwoot Provider (gomake-web)
    ↓ JWT Bearer Token
messaging-hub-v2 (NestJS Proxy)
    ↓ Auto-provisioning + Path Transformation
Chatwoot Backend (Rails API)
```

